154 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This project focuses on developing an efficient Library Management System to streamline the organization of books, users, and transactions. It provides key functionalities such as user registration, book search, borrowing, renewing, and fine management. The system categorizes resources based on subjects, authors, and topics for easy retrieval. With a user-friendly interface built using modern tools, it enhances accessibility for both students and staff. By automating routine tasks and minimizing manual errors, the system improves resource utilization and ensures smooth library operations, showcasing the impact of digital solutions in modern library management.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
