162 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Library management has evolved from ancient knowledge preservation to modern digital systems. The printing press revolutionized access to books, transforming libraries into organized institutions. Today, automation, online catalogs, and digital databases enhance efficiency, balancing physical and digital collections. Looking ahead, AI, digital transformation, and global collaboration will shape libraries, requiring strategic management to address copyright, preservation, and accessibility challenges.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
