164 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 317 0 R
/E (The Library Management System \(LMS\) automates and streamlines library operations, including book issues, returns, and record-keeping. It maintains a comprehensive user database, tracking member details and borrowing history. Designed for efficiency and accessibility, the system supports Windows, Linux, and Mac OS, offering a user-friendly interface, multilingual support, and easy book management. With features like cataloging, circulation control, and report generation, LMS enhances library administration, ensuring smooth operations and improved user experience.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
