/E (The Administrator Module provides librarians and system administrators with complete control over library management. It allows them to add, update, or remove books, manage book issuance and returns, track overdue books, and enforce fine collection. Users are classified as students and staff, each with different borrowing privileges. The system also generates reports on book usage, reservations, and fines, helping administrators analyze library trends and improve resource)
