/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 324 0 R
/E (The User Module enables students and staff to search, borrow, return, and reserve books seamlessly. Users must log in to access services, manage their profiles, and track their borrowing history. The system provides an intuitive book search feature based on title, author, or category. It also enforces borrowing limits and due dates while automatically calculating fines for overdue books. With features like reservation notifications and renewal requests, the system enhances accessibility and ensures smooth library operations.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [4]
>>
